## Proposed Changes & File Operations

### 1. Setlist Export & Import Service
**File**: `lib/features/setlist/data/setlist_export_import_service.dart` (New File)

- Implement `SetlistExportImportService` provider and class:
  - `exportSetlistsToFolder(List<SavedSetlist> setlists, String targetFolderPath)`:
    - Iterates over selected setlists.
    - Resolves associated `Song` entities from Isar for each setlist.
    - Serializes setlist details + song data into structured JSON map.
    - Writes each file to `<targetFolderPath>/<sanitized_setlist_name>.json`.
  - `importSetlistFromFile(String filePath)`:
    - Reads and decodes JSON file.
    - Upserts any included song payloads into Isar DB (`isar.songs.put`) if not present.
    - Re-links song IDs to local Isar IDs.
    - Upserts `SavedSetlist` in Isar database.
    - Triggers `SyncService.exportSetlist` if sync is enabled.

